---
// src/components/home/InteractiveServicesSection.astro
// GVF Interactive Split + Stats Section
---

<section class="gvf-interactive-section" id="layanan">
  <div class="gvf-interactive-container">
    <div class="gvf-interactive-header">
      <h2 class="gvf-interactive-title">
        Membangun Ekosistem Terpadu untuk Generasi yang Berkarakter, Kompeten, dan Mandiri
      </h2>

      <p class="gvf-interactive-sub">
        Sebuah ekosistem yang mengintegrasikan sarana ibadah, pendidikan dan vokasi, pertanian produktif, serta infrastruktur penunjang dalam satu kesatuan yang saling mendukung. Dirancang untuk membentuk generasi santri yang berkarakter, memiliki kompetensi profesional, serta mampu tumbuh dan berkontribusi secara mandiri.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="gvf-interactive-split">
      <div class="gvf-preview-card" id="service-preview-panel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="service-tab-0">
        <div class="gvf-preview-media">
          <img
            id="preview-img"
            src="https://br-billowing-mountain-aomqpcdy.storage.c-2.ap-southeast-1.aws.neon.tech/gvf-website/gvf/assets/bahan-konten/kegiatan-dan-prestasi-santri/kbm-santri-ikhwan-menulis.webp"
            alt="Pendidikan dan Pembinaan Karakter Santri"
            class="gvf-preview-image"
          />
        </div>

        <div class="gvf-glass-caption">
          <p id="preview-caption-text">
            Pembinaan adab, kurikulum vokasi FAST, dan tahfidz Al-Quran intensif untuk mencetak santri yang berakhlak mulia dan mandiri.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="gvf-services-list" role="tablist" aria-label="Daftar Ekosistem Terpadu">
        <button
          type="button"
          class="gvf-service-item is-active"
          id="service-tab-0"
          role="tab"
          aria-selected="true"
          aria-controls="service-preview-panel"
          tabindex="0"
          data-index="0"
          data-img="https://br-billowing-mountain-aomqpcdy.storage.c-2.ap-southeast-1.aws.neon.tech/gvf-website/gvf/assets/bahan-konten/kegiatan-dan-prestasi-santri/kbm-santri-ikhwan-menulis.webp"
          data-caption="Pembinaan adab, kurikulum vokasi FAST, dan tahfidz Al-Quran intensif untuk mencetak santri yang berakhlak mulia dan mandiri."
        >
          <div class="gvf-item-left">
            <span class="gvf-item-num">01</span>
            <span class="gvf-item-title">Pendidikan &amp; Pembinaan Karakter</span>
          </div>
          <div class="gvf-item-arrow-wrap">
            <span class="gvf-item-arrow-circle">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" class="gvf-arrow-svg">
                <line x1="7" y1="17" x2="17" y2="7"></line>
                <polyline points="7 7 17 7 17 17"></polyline>
              </svg>
            </span>
          </div>
        </button>

        <button
          type="button"
          class="gvf-service-item"
          id="service-tab-1"
          role="tab"
          aria-selected="false"
          aria-controls="service-preview-panel"
          tabindex="-1"
          data-index="1"
          data-img="https://br-billowing-mountain-aomqpcdy.storage.c-2.ap-southeast-1.aws.neon.tech/gvf-website/gvf/assets/bahan-konten/masjid-dan-kelas/kandang-ayam-petelur.jpeg"
          data-caption="Unit usaha produktif peternakan ayam petelur dan praktik kewirausahaan santri vokasi sebagai bekal kemandirian ekonomi nyata."
        >
          <div class="gvf-item-left">
            <span class="gvf-item-num">02</span>
            <span class="gvf-item-title">Keterampilan Vokasi &amp; Wirausaha</span>
          </div>
          <div class="gvf-item-arrow-wrap">
            <span class="gvf-item-arrow-circle">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" class="gvf-arrow-svg">
                <line x1="7" y1="17" x2="17" y2="7"></line>
                <polyline points="7 7 17 7 17 17"></polyline>
              </svg>
            </span>
          </div>
        </button>

        <button
          type="button"
          class="gvf-service-item"
          id="service-tab-2"
          role="tab"
          aria-selected="false"
          aria-controls="service-preview-panel"
          tabindex="-1"
          data-index="2"
          data-img="https://br-billowing-mountain-aomqpcdy.storage.c-2.ap-southeast-1.aws.neon.tech/gvf-website/gvf/assets/bahan-konten/masjid-dan-kelas/lahan-kebun.jpeg"
          data-caption="Budidaya sayuran hijau segar dan pemanfaatan lahan kebun produktif sebagai penopang ketahanan pangan mandiri santri."
        >
          <div class="gvf-item-left">
            <span class="gvf-item-num">03</span>
            <span class="gvf-item-title">Pertanian Produktif &amp; Pangan</span>
          </div>
          <div class="gvf-item-arrow-wrap">
            <span class="gvf-item-arrow-circle">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" class="gvf-arrow-svg">
                <line x1="7" y1="17" x2="17" y2="7"></line>
                <polyline points="7 7 17 7 17 17"></polyline>
              </svg>
            </span>
          </div>
        </button>

        <button
          type="button"
          class="gvf-service-item"
          id="service-tab-3"
          role="tab"
          aria-selected="false"
          aria-controls="service-preview-panel"
          tabindex="-1"
          data-index="3"
          data-img="https://br-billowing-mountain-aomqpcdy.storage.c-2.ap-southeast-1.aws.neon.tech/gvf-website/gvf/assets/bahan-konten/fasilitas-dan-infrastruktur/pelataran-depan-masjid.webp"
          data-caption="Masjid Khairu Ummah Sugro sebagai pusat ibadah kawasan terpadu serta fasilitas asrama santri yang bersih dan tertata."
        >
          <div class="gvf-item-left">
            <span class="gvf-item-num">04</span>
            <span class="gvf-item-title">Fasilitas Kehidupan &amp; Ibadah</span>
          </div>
          <div class="gvf-item-arrow-wrap">
            <span class="gvf-item-arrow-circle">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" class="gvf-arrow-svg">
                <line x1="7" y1="17" x2="17" y2="7"></line>
                <polyline points="7 7 17 7 17 17"></polyline>
              </svg>
            </span>
          </div>
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Client Interactivity Script -->
<script>
  const serviceItems = document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('.gvf-service-item');
  const previewImg = document.getElementById('preview-img') as HTMLImageElement;
  const captionText = document.getElementById('preview-caption-text');
  const previewPanel = document.getElementById('service-preview-panel');

  function activateTab(index: number) {
    serviceItems.forEach((btn, idx) => {
      const isTarget = idx === index;
      btn.classList.toggle('is-active', isTarget);
      btn.setAttribute('aria-selected', String(isTarget));
      btn.setAttribute('tabindex', isTarget ? '0' : '-1');
      if (isTarget) {
        btn.focus();
        previewPanel?.setAttribute('aria-labelledby', btn.id);

        const imgSrc = btn.getAttribute('data-img');
        const caption = btn.getAttribute('data-caption');

        if (previewImg && imgSrc) {
          previewImg.style.opacity = '0';
          previewImg.style.transform = 'scale(0.97)';
          setTimeout(() => {
            previewImg.src = imgSrc;
            previewImg.alt = btn.querySelector('.gvf-item-title')?.textContent || 'Pratinjau Layanan';
            previewImg.style.opacity = '1';
            previewImg.style.transform = 'scale(1)';
          }, 180);
        }

        if (captionText && caption) {
          captionText.style.opacity = '0';
          setTimeout(() => {
            captionText.innerHTML = caption;
            captionText.style.opacity = '1';
          }, 180);
        }
      }
    });
  }

  serviceItems.forEach((btn, idx) => {
    btn.addEventListener('click', () => activateTab(idx));

    // Keyboard Arrow Navigation
    btn.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {
      if (e.key === 'ArrowDown' || e.key === 'ArrowRight') {
        e.preventDefault();
        activateTab((idx + 1) % serviceItems.length);
      } else if (e.key === 'ArrowUp' || e.key === 'ArrowLeft') {
        e.preventDefault();
        activateTab((idx - 1 + serviceItems.length) % serviceItems.length);
      }
    });
  });
</script>

<style>
  .gvf-interactive-section {
    position: relative;
    background-color: #ffffff;
    padding: 60px 0 80px 0;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .gvf-interactive-container {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 1425px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 24px;
  }

  /* Header Centered */
  .gvf-interactive-header {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 48px;
  }

  .header-badge-pill {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 5px 14px 5px 10px;
    background: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    border-radius: 32px;
    box-shadow: 0px 1px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .header-dot-halo {
    position: relative;
    width: 14px;
    height: 14px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .header-halo-ring {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: rgba(9, 105, 218, 0.12);
  }

  .header-core-dot {
    position: relative;
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #0969da;
  }

  .header-badge-text {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #000000;
    letter-spacing: 0.2px;
    font-family: 'Golos Text', system-ui, sans-serif;
  }

  .gvf-interactive-title {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.2vw, 48px);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: #000000;
    font-family: 'Golos Text', system-ui, sans-serif;
    margin: 0 0 16px 0;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .gvf-interactive-sub {
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 26px;
    color: #62625b;
    max-width: 820px;
    margin: 0;
    text-align: justify;
    text-justify: inter-word;
    text-align-last: center;
    font-family: 'Golos Text', system-ui, sans-serif;
  }

  /* 2-Column Split */
  .gvf-interactive-split {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 0.95fr 1.05fr;
    gap: 40px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  /* Left: Preview Card with 16px Radius */
  .gvf-preview-card {
    position: relative;
    border-radius: 16px;
    overflow: hidden;
    height: 500px;
    background-color: #061829;
  }

  .gvf-preview-media {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .gvf-preview-image {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
    transition: opacity 240ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.2, 1), transform 240ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.2, 1);
  }

  /* Glass Floating Box Inside Image */
  .gvf-glass-caption {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 20px;
    left: 20px;
    right: 20px;
    max-width: 440px;
    background: #061829;
    opacity: 0.95;
    backdrop-filter: blur(14.5px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(14.5px);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 24px 30px;
  }

  .gvf-glass-caption p {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 26px;
    color: #ffffff;
    margin: 0;
    font-family: 'Golos Text', system-ui, sans-serif;
    text-align: justify;
    text-justify: inter-word;
    text-align-last: left;
    transition: opacity 180ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.2, 1);
  }

  /* Right: Interactive List */
  .gvf-services-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .gvf-service-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    width: 100%;
    padding: 20px 0;
    background: transparent;
    border: none;
    text-align: left;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-family: 'Golos Text', system-ui, sans-serif;
    transition: color 180ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.2, 1), transform 180ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.2, 1);
  }

  .gvf-service-item:active {
    transform: scale(0.99);
  }

  .gvf-service-item:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid #0969da;
    outline-offset: 4px;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }

  .gvf-service-item:first-child {
    border-top: none;
  }

  .gvf-item-left {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 16px;
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .gvf-item-num {
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #62625b;
    font-family: 'Golos Text', system-ui, sans-serif;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    transition: color 180ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.2, 1);
  }

  .gvf-item-title {
    font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 1.75vw, 28px);
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.25;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    color: #000000;
    font-family: 'Golos Text', system-ui, sans-serif;
    white-space: nowrap;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
    transition: color 180ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.2, 1);
  }

  /* Arrow Circle */
  .gvf-item-arrow-circle {
    width: 42px;
    height: 42px;
    border-radius: 32px;
    background-color: #0969da;
    color: #ffffff;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    transition: transform 180ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.2, 1), background-color 180ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.2, 1);
  }

  .gvf-arrow-svg {
    width: 18px;
    height: 18px;
  }

  /* ACTIVE STATE */
  .gvf-service-item.is-active .gvf-item-num {
    color: #0969da;
  }

  .gvf-service-item.is-active .gvf-item-title {
    color: #0969da;
  }

  .gvf-service-item.is-active .gvf-item-arrow-circle {
    transform: rotate(-45deg);
  }

  .gvf-service-item:hover:not(.is-active) .gvf-item-title {
    color: #0969da;
  }

  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .gvf-interactive-split {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 36px;
    }
    .gvf-preview-card {
      height: 380px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .gvf-item-title {
      font-size: clamp(0.92rem, 3.8vw, 1.15rem);
    }
    .gvf-item-left {
      gap: 12px;
    }
    .gvf-item-arrow-circle {
      width: 36px;
      height: 36px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }
  }
</style>
